-.B IORING_OP_LINKAT
-Issue the equivalent of a
-.BR linkat (2)
-system call.
-.I fd
-should be set to the
-.IR olddirfd ,
-.I addr
-should be set to the
-.IR oldpath ,
-.I len
-should be set to the
-.IR newdirfd ,
-.I addr2
-should be set to the
-.IR newpath ,
-and
-.I hardlink_flags
-should be set to the
-.I flags
-being passed in to
-.BR linkat (2).
