-.TP
-.B IORING_OP_BIND
-Issues the equivalent of the
-.BR bind (2)
-system call.
-.I fd
-must contain the file descriptor of the socket,
-.I addr
-must contain a pointer to the sockaddr struct containing the address to assign
-and
