+# NAME
+
+io_uring_submit_and_wait - submit requests to the submission queue and
+wait for completion
+
+# SYNOPSIS
+
+``` text
+#include <liburing.h>
+
+ int io_uring_submit_and_wait(struct io_uring * ring ,
+                              unsigned  wait_nr );
+```
+
+# DESCRIPTION
+
+The **io_uring_submit_and_wait**(3) function submits the next requests
+from the submission queue belonging to the *ring* and waits for
+*wait_nr* completion events.
